	)
	(text "POWER ARCHITECTURE  -  SINGULARITY ROBO\n3S LiPo 11.1V (12.6V max) 2200mAh 80C\nA] +11V_MOTOR -> U2 L298N VS   (motors)\nB] +11V_MOTOR -> U5 LM2596S-ADJ -> +5V\nC] +11V_MOTOR -> U6 LM2596S-ADJ -> +5V_SERVO\n   (dedicated high-current servo rail)\n\n+5V feeds: Raspberry Pi, PCA9685 VDD,\nHC-SR04, ESP32-CAM, TFT, FlySky RX,\nBluetooth speaker power.\n\n+5V_SERVO feeds: servo V+ rail J4-J7 ONLY.\n\n*** DO NOT CONNECT 11.1V TO RASPBERRY PI ***\nU1 5V pins are fed ONLY from U5 +5V.\n\nALL GROUNDS COMMON: battery - = GND.\nMotor 11.1V / logic 5V / servo 5V rails\nkept separate; PWR_FLAG marks each source."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f3f9afe8-b2b9-5004-a4f7-729ed46e5d38")
	)
	(text "6 .  HC-SR04 ULTRASONIC + ECHO DIVIDER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 112 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f5d8c86e-2a19-5f09-b50a-dd8a5cd0d03b")
	)
	(text "8 .  ILI9341 2.4in SPI TFT + TOUCH"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 360 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f747c29d-026d-526a-850b-6112f897d098")
	)
	(text "SERVO POWER RAIL: +5V_SERVO from U6 only.\nHeader: 1 SIGNAL . 2 +5V_SERVO . 3 GND\n(common ground).  NEVER from Pi 5V GPIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 470 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fa59d2a5-efe3-5b9c-8dd8-38e747b12c44")
	)
	(text "FLYSKY FS-i6X  -  WIRELESS TRANSMITTER\n(2.4 GHz) binds to J1 FS-iA10B receiver.\nCH1-CH4 drive / camera, CH5 = NAMASTE.\nPi reads the PWM channel pulses on GPIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 460 276.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fe3e9309-0788-5e29-9f31-0b5fd95a878c")
	)
